  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Adolescent girls initiative action research programme (AGIARP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall purpose of the research is to test combinations of interventions for vulnerable adolescent girls in the areas of health, wealth creation,
prevention of violence and education so as to demonstrate the combination with the greatest impact that is also the most cost effective.</narrative>
  </description>
